| `app/src/org/commcare/utils/PersonalIdAuthService.kt` | modify | Takes `AuthInfo` and a nullable session |
| `app/src/org/commcare/utils/FirebaseAuthService.java` | modify | Takes `AuthInfo` and a nullable session |
| `app/src/org/commcare/connect/network/personalId/ApiPersonalId.java` | modify | Phone OTP calls take `AuthInfo` |
| `app/src/org/commcare/connect/network/personalId/PersonalIdApiHandler.java` | modify | Phone OTP handlers take `AuthInfo` and a nullable session |
| `app/res/navigation/nav_graph_personalid_profile.xml` | modify | New destination and actions |
| `app/src/org/commcare/personalId/profile/PersonalIdProfileBackupCodeFragment.kt` | modify | Forgot? branch, `masked=false`, cancelled analytics |
| `app/src/org/commcare/personalId/profile/ProfileEmailAnalytics.kt` | create | Add-vs-update email analytics helper |
